{"version":2,"text":"4. The extract conveys the need to\n\nA\n\ndevelop patient-centred healthcare service skills\n\nB\n\nadopt approaches to achieve excellence in practice\n\nC\n\ninculcate skills required by practice developers\n\nCharacteristics, Qualities and Skills\n\nWhilst the primary role and function of practice development is the promotion and facilitation of patient-\ncentred health care services within a department and organization, there had been little work undertaken\nexamining the systems and processes involved in achieving this. The importance of capturing was to be\nclearer about the approaches taken to develop excellence in practice at different organizational levela and\nin addition, differentiate the skills and activities inherent in those working in practice development that still\nare predominantly nurses. Garbett & McCormack’s substantial study analysing the cocept of practice\ndevelopment formed the basis for further description and postulation of the characteristics, qualities and\nskills of practice developers that remains ongoing.\n\nStudy guide for OET © IRS Group 2018\n\nPage 474","layout":{"version":1,"width":609.0,"height":808.0,"blocks":[{"text":"4. The extract conveys the need to","lines":[{"text":"4. The extract conveys the need to","x":0.10237274384236454,"y":0.06568688118811881,"width":0.2512397389162562,"height":0.013811881188118807,"confidence":1,"words":[{"text":"4.","x":0.10237274384236454,"width":0.01379310344827586,"confidence":1},{"text":"The","x":0.12376849425287356,"width":0.02829228243021347,"confidence":1},{"text":"extract","x":0.15586206403940886,"width":0.04927750410509032,"confidence":1},{"text":"conveys","x":0.2089409146141215,"width":0.060229885057471254,"confidence":1},{"text":"the","x":0.2729721264367816,"width":0.022824302134646972,"confidence":1},{"text":"need","x":0.299597711001642,"width":0.036518883415435154,"confidence":1},{"text":"to","x":0.33991790147783246,"width":0.013694581280788183,"confidence":1}]}]